  description: "You cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck. When you
    Tribute Summon a monster: You can activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25CF Add, from
    your Deck to your hand, 1 monster with 2400 ATK and 1000 DEF with a different
    name from that Tribute Summoned monster.\n\u25CF Add, from your Deck to your
    hand, 1 monster with 2800 ATK and 1000 DEF with a different name from that Tribute
    Summoned monster.\nThe Tribute Summoned monster must be face-up on the field
    to activate and to resolve this effect. You can only use this effect of \"Return
    of the Monarchs\" once per turn."
